--- Myna: a workbench over Magpie, written in Crow. `crow run main.co`
--- from this folder serves it on port 3800: the Code page (the project's
--- files, its notebooks as cells of Crow run as one program, every save a
--- file and every run kept in a Magpie log), the catalog of the data
--- folder's tables, the queries over them (saved, and taken into a
--- notebook), the dashboards, the jobs (the scheduler and every run), the
--- experiments and models, the users and their grants, and the settings.
--- Myna's own folder is myna_data/ beside the program (or the folder
--- MYNA_DATA names); ./test.sh runs the tests. The pages and routes are
--- the package's (myna/main.co): an app that depends on Myna serves them
--- the same way, with its own pages after (docs/platform.md).
use web, ui
use myna.main

here = main.ready[3800]
serve[3800, wide = true, refresh = 10, files = main.builds[]]
pages = main.pages[]
